{
  "title": "Vitalis 周报 · 本周睡眠与训练结构",
  "content": "<div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 12px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#eef3f3;color:#14202b;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#0f3d3a;color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#9fd3c9\">VITALIS · 周报</p><h1 style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#ffffff\">本周睡眠与训练结构</h1><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#c5e3dd\">2026-09-28—2026-10-04 · 数据截至 2026-10-07 21:20 · 合成数据</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">关键记录</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">平均睡眠</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">7 小时 30 分钟</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2f4;color:#4a5964;font-weight:600\">↑ 0.3%</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">上期 · 2026-09-21—2026-09-27 · 7 小时 29 分钟</span></p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">平均步数</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">11,948 步/日</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#e6f4ec;color:#127a3e;font-weight:600\">↑ 4.9%</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">上期 · 2026-09-21—2026-09-27 · 11,388 步/日</span></p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">力量训练频次</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">2 次</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">睡眠与恢复变化</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">睡眠有效 7 天，平均 450 分钟；前一期平均 449 分钟，变化 0.3%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">睡眠心率变异性有效 7 天，中位数 55.5 毫秒；前一期 58.4 毫秒，变化 -4.9%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">静息心率有效 7 天，中位数 56.9 次/分钟；前一期 55.2 次/分钟，变化 3.1%。</p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">入睡时间每天大约相差</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">0 分钟</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">睡眠中点大约在</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">03:05</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">平均睡眠较前一期增加 0.3%，这会影响本周训练剂量的可持续性判断。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">恢复信号较前一期变化：HRV -4.9%；静息心率 +3.1%，训练结构调整仍需结合覆盖和既有门控。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">平均睡眠处于成年人通常建议的 7–9 小时范围内。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">入睡时刻相对稳定，继续保持固定作息。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">跑步与力量结构</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">训练场次</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">3 次</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">训练时长</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">122 分钟</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">设备训练负荷</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">112</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">有氧时长</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">32 分钟</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">力量场次</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">2 次</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">力量：90 分钟；明确明细 2 场；明确组数 24 组。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">设备记录组数合计 24 组，来自 2 场有组数记录的力量训练；不等同于已取得逐组动作明细。</p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">训练热量 540 千卡，来自</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">3 场有热量记录</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">已记录的 3 次训练中，2 次填了 RPE（Zepp），平均 7/10。RPE 越高，主观感觉越吃力。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#e2f1ee;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">下周重点</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">力量：本周力量训练 2 次。下周按 3 次力量训练安排：上肢→下肢→全身（也可全身 A/B 交替）。同一部位别连续两天练重，漏练就顺延，不补课。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">记录曲线</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4e9;border-radius:8px\"><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#192e3b\">每日主睡眠时长</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">按本地日期排列；空白日表示没有合资格记录，不代表零或休息日。</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">09-28 00:00—10-05 00:00 · Asia/Shanghai</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">每日主睡眠时长 · zepp</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">已保存桶中位数 · 纵轴 440—460 min</p><div style=\"position:relative;height:48px;margin:5px 3px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe4e9;background:#f5f8fa\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0%;bottom:85.5%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:14.286%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:28.571%;bottom:18%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:42.857%;bottom:67.5%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:57.143%;bottom:76.5%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:71.429%;bottom:4.5%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:85.714%;bottom:9%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span></div><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">09-28 00:00 459 min → 10-04 00:00 442 min</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4e9;border-radius:8px\"><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#192e3b\">Zepp 7 日训练负荷与厂商参考区间</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">7 日累计与参考区间直接来自 Zepp；每天的累计值不再相加。</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">09-28 00:00—10-05 00:00 · Asia/Shanghai</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">Zepp 7 日累计 · zepp</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">已保存桶中位数 · 纵轴 200—400 load</p><div style=\"position:relative;height:48px;margin:5px 3px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe4e9;background:#f5f8fa\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0%;bottom:74.25%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:14.286%;bottom:79.65%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:28.571%;bottom:20.25%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:42.857%;bottom:25.65%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:57.143%;bottom:31.05%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:71.429%;bottom:36.45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:85.714%;bottom:41.85%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#2878b5\"></span></div><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">09-28 00:00 365 load → 10-04 00:00 293 load</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">Zepp 超负荷参考线 · zepp</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">已保存桶中位数 · 纵轴 440—500 load</p><div style=\"position:relative;height:48px;margin:5px 3px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe4e9;background:#f5f8fa\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:14.286%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:28.571%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:42.857%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:57.143%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:71.429%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:85.714%;bottom:45%;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#d46b28\"></span></div><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">09-28 00:00 470 load → 10-04 00:00 470 load</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4e9;border-radius:8px\"><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#192e3b\">肌群训练接触 · 主要与辅助组数</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">窗口内 2 场力量训练</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">0 个记录组缺少可定位肌群依据</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">颜色表示有依据的训练接触组数；主要与辅助分开，不是实测肌肉受力或有效增肌组。</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">09-28 00:00—10-05 00:00 · Asia/Shanghai</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">背部 · 主要 12 组 · 辅助 0 组</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">肱二头肌 · 主要 6 组 · 辅助 12 组</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">肩部 · 主要 6 组 · 辅助 0 组</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">训练接触估算，非实测肌肉受力；已记录参与组数不是有效组数，各部位不可相加。</p></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#7a8892;text-align:center\">由 Vitalis 根据已保存数据生成，无需回复</p>\n</div>",
